TI  - 3-D Building Instance Extraction From High-Resolution Remote Sensing Images and DSM With an End-to-End Deep Neural Network
JO  - IEEE Transactions on Geoscience and Remote Sensing
PY  - 2024
VL  - 62
PB  - IEEE
DO  - 10.1109/TGRS.2024.3383432
