TI  - From Coarse to Fine: Learning Semantic Relations for Hyperspectral Image Classification
JO  - IGARSS 2023 - 2023 IEEE International Geoscience and Remote Sensing Symposium
PY  - 2023
PB  - IEEE
DO  - 10.1109/IGARSS52108.2023.10281715
