TI  - Suspended Sediment Concentrate Estimation From Landsat Imagery and Hydrological Station in Poyang Lake Using Machine Learning
JO  - IEEE Access
PY  - 2024
VL  - 12
PB  - IEEE
DO  - 10.1109/ACCESS.2024.3414996
