TI  - RCACNet: A Deep Convolutional Neural Network With Fused Cross-Level Atrous Features and Attention Mechanisms for Rare-Earth Ore-Forming Target Prediction
JO  - IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth Observations and Remote Sensing
PY  - 2026
VL  - 19
