TI  - Bidirectional Spatio-Temporal Association Between the Observed Results of Ulva Prolifera Green Tides in the Yellow Sea and the Social Response in Sina Weibo
JO  - IEEE Journal of Selected Topics in Applied Earth Observations and Remote Sensing
PY  - 2021
VL  - 14
PB  - IEEE
DO  - 10.1109/JSTARS.2021.3085090
