TI  - EcoProfiler: An Enhanced Open-Source Intelligence Framework with Centralized Logging for Environmental Crime Detection and Visualization
JO  - 2026 International Conference on Next-Gen Quantum and Advanced Computing: Algorithms, Security, and Beyond (NQComp)
PY  - 2026
