TI  - Geometrical Pattern Estimation and Resistivity Cross Section Imaging of The Lembang Fault Using Electrical Resistivity and TEM (Transient Electromagnetic) Methods
JO  - 2025 International Conference on Radar, Antenna, Microwave, Electronics, and Telecommunications (ICRAMET)
PY  - 2025
PB  - IEEE
